{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id19542728"}, "name":{"label":"MrBass"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-11-26T10:29:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1292025174"}, "title":{"label":"Dodgy Alerts"}, "content":{"label":"As another reviewer has mentioned, the notification system with this app is irritatingly buggy. Not sure if it's a sync issue with the watch or something else but I've lost count of the number of times I've cleared the alert on my watch only to get notified again 5 minutes later. Not only that I also get an alert to clear the notifications in Due to allow for continued notifications - the rub being that I have no notifications to clear! I'd hold off paying for this app until these issues are resolved.\n\nUpdate: Reduced to 1⭐️ as I removed all but one reminder (which had the default 5 min auto-snooze) and it can't even get that right - prompts every minute, after 5 of which I clicked 'Mark Done' out of frustration, only to get it prompt me again a minute later! Alert along with this useless app now deleted. Absolute waste of money.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
