{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id35631924"}, "name":{"label":"fire&ice"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-04-06T21:35:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1179101709"}, "title":{"label":"Great but sync (useless)"}, "content":{"label":"Dont get me wrong the apps good - however the iCloud sync doesn't happen in the background. So altering your iPhones due date wont alter your iPad until you open the iPad app. \n\nUnfortunately the iPad apps is already alerting you to the old due time/date so 90% of the time it just gets stuck in an infinite loop until you also alter the due date to the exact same time. If not you get a sync conflict. Making sync redundant.\n\nThe unadjusted alerts on the iPad (if left unsupervised) also wear down your battery - very annoying!\nI deleted it from iPad- very sad\n\nApp 5 stars - sync 0", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42786412"}, "name":{"label":"mrplowinc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-03-30T09:08:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1175442794"}, "title":{"label":"Great if you only use it on a single device"}, "content":{"label":"Across multiple devices it's syncing is patchy, slow and unreliable at best. Most of the time it only syncs if your sat there with the app open in front of you. Tried iCloud, Dropbox, support advice etc but still not reliable. Other 3rd party apps sync flawlessly. Shame this one doesn't, as multi device sync is an essential feature for me \nHowever, if you're using it on a single device its a great reminder app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
